The MIT terms above cover NodeRadar's own code and textures. They do NOT
cover the six alert sounds in Media/, royalty-free sound effects from
Pixabay (https://pixabay.com), used under the Pixabay Content License
(https://pixabay.com/service/terms/). They ship inside NodeRadar only and
may not be redistributed as files of their own:

  Media/Sonar.ogg          "sonar ping", Pixabay #95840, freesound_community
  Media/RadarBlip.ogg      "radar ping", Pixabay #306440, user 49053354
  Media/DeepSea.ogg        "deepsea sonar", Pixabay #386156, Dragon Studio
  Media/BellChime.ogg      "clear bell chime", Pixabay #487898, Universfield
  Media/Notification.ogg   "new notification 016", Pixabay #350210,
                           Universfield
  Media/HudPing.ogg        "sci-fi HUD notification ping", Pixabay #547867,
                           vadim_makes_sound

Each was trimmed, made mono and evened in loudness (Tools/import_sounds.py).
